      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><a class=\"ds-chip is-active\" href=\"#\">All</a><a class=\"ds-chip\" href=\"#\">Main building</a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:8px;}.ds-chip{min-height:40px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:0 16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;background:var(--white);color:var(--ink);font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;}.ds-chip:hover{border-color:var(--green-3);}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--green-3);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-chip.is-active{background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);color:var(--white);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sidebar Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "The desktop pine sidebar. Phones use four bottom tabs.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-nav-item is-active\" href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 11 12 4l9 7\"/><path d=\"M6 10v10h12V10\"/></svg>Dashboard</a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"6\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 10h18\"/></svg>Payments</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{width:232px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:18px 14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--side),var(--side-2));}.ds-nav-item{min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:0 12px;color:#e4f3eb;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;}.ds-nav-item:hover{color:var(--white);background:rgb(255 255 255 / .08);}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--amber);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-nav-item.is-active{background:var(--green-2);color:var(--white);font-weight:700;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Overdue Summary Tile",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "tile-overdue",
      "description": "A tinted headline figure. Collected, due and expected tiles share the form.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tile\"><span class=\"ds-tile-icon\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4 3 20h18L12 4Z\"/><path d=\"M12 10v4M12 17h.01\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-tile-text\"><strong>₹20,000</strong><span>Overdue</span></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tile{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px;border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--red-bg);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:var(--shadow);}.ds-tile-icon{width:42px;height:42px;flex:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:50%;background:#fbd6d2;color:var(--red);}.ds-tile-text{display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600;}.ds-tile strong{font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.2;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Room Card",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "room-card-overdue",
      "description": "The signature status card, shown in its overdue state.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-room\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-room-no\">102</span><span class=\"ds-room-name\">Tenant name</span><span class=\"ds-room-amount\">₹10,000</span><span class=\"ds-room-status\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4 3 20h18L12 4Z\"/><path d=\"M12 10v4M12 17h.01\"/></svg>3 days late</span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-room{width:180px;min-height:136px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;padding:12px;background:var(--red-bg);color:var(--ink);border:1.5px solid var(--red);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);text-decoration:none;transition:transform .15s var(--ease),box-shadow .15s;}.ds-room:hover{box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgb(13 74 56 / .13);}.ds-room:active{transform:scale(.98);}.ds-room:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--green-3);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-room-no{padding:1px 8px;background:var(--red);color:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:800;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-room-name{margin-top:6px;font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700;}.ds-room-amount{font-size:.9375rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.ds-room-status{margin-top:auto;padding-top:4px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;color:#9f2622;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:700;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Morning Rent Ledger",
    "overview": "RentRoll is the calm first look at the day's money. A deep green frame holds white cards on a pale mint ground, and the first thing on any rent screen is who has paid, who is due and who is late. The tone is trustworthy and unhurried, so a landlord can read it between other tasks on a mid-range phone in daylight.\n\nDensity stays moderate. Tinted summary tiles give the headline numbers, a single list names the people to act on, and room cards hold the full picture below. Soft shadows and rounded corners make the product feel approachable, while strict status color keeps it serious about money.\n\nThe public landing page speaks in the same materials at a larger scale. It may use a tilted sample phone and a large mint disc to persuade. The logged-in app stays square to the grid and spends its emphasis on rent status.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Deep green sidebar and primary actions on a pale mint ground.",
      "White cards with soft green-tinted shadows and 14px corners.",
      "Mint, amber, red and slate summary tiles.",
      "Figtree at every level, with tabular rupee figures.",
